r=add(14,'Creamed Carrots with Onion',4,40,'Carrots and onion cook together before cream mixed with flour lightly thickens their cooking liquid.',[lard(15),onion(100),carrot(500),water(400),salt(2),pepper(),cream(180),flour(12)],['Heat {{lard}} in a saucepan and soften sliced {{onion}} for 5 minutes. Add {{carrot}} cut into 5 mm rounds, {{water}}, {{salt}} and {{pepper}}.','Cover and simmer for 15–25 minutes until tender, stirring occasionally. Add a little water if the pan begins to dry.','Whisk {{flour}} into {{cream}} until smooth. Stir into the vegetables and simmer gently for 5–7 minutes to cook the flour. Loosen with a little hot water if too thick and serve.'],'The source three-quarter cup of cream becomes 180 ml; carrot, lard, flour and water amounts are modern additions. All cooking liquid stays in the sauce.')
